README.txt -rw------- aee0d4de8f1f57ac
	Bridge configuration backup.

	To restore on a new machine: put config.json at the default config location
	(~/.fridolin/config.json), restore each brain folder from <brain-id>/current, and pair WhatsApp
	again from the dashboard.
	The WhatsApp session, .env files and tokens are deliberately not backed up.
brains/ -rwx------
